  A   0   0   0   0   0   1   1   1
  G   0   1   1   1   1   1   1   1
  G   0   1   1   1   1   1   1   1
  T   0   1   1   2   2   2   2   2
  A   0   1   1   2   2   3   3   3
  B   0   1   1   2   2   3   3   4
```

`dp[6][7]` would be 4, which is the length of the LCS ("GTAB").

